WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.455
Hi, Leo! Welcome back! How was your vacation?

2
00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:06.948
Hi, Sarah! It was amazing!

3
00:00:08.398 --> 00:00:09.605
Where did you go?

4
00:00:10.055 --> 00:00:13.678
I went to Japan! I stayed in Tokyo for one week.

5
00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:17.414
When did you travel?

6
00:00:17.864 --> 00:00:21.858
In April. I saw the cherry blossoms. So beautiful!

7
00:00:24.108 --> 00:00:25.733
Did you eat sushi?

8
00:00:26.183 --> 00:00:28.133
Yes, I did. Every day!

9
00:00:30.383 --> 00:00:32.287
Did you visit temples?

10
00:00:32.737 --> 00:00:36.824
Yes, I did. I visited a lot of temples in Tokyo and Kyoto.

11
00:00:39.074 --> 00:00:40.932
Did you see Mount Fuji?

12
00:00:41.382 --> 00:00:43.982
No, I didn't. It rained a lot that day.

13
00:00:46.232 --> 00:00:49.530
Wow. I want to go to Japan, too!

14
00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.509
And you? Where did you go on your last vacation?

